<p>Advertisement from 1883 Mandan Pioneer The Millers remained in Mandan until 1885 with their daughter, Maude, when they moved to Saline, Kansas. Maude married in 1887 and moved to Denver. Clarke would work with Star Grocery until his death in 1891. Alice accompanied Clarke’s body to Iowa City where he was buried, and appears to have stayed there with her sister. On February 23, 1893, Zalmon and Alice married in Humboldt, Iowa, and they moved back to Mandan. Tragically, less than a month later she died on March 24 of heart ailments.</p>

